24:["$","p","p-4",{"children":["Set a maximum in-flight count per worker and a per-tenant quota. A broker prefetch or batch setting that hands one worker hundreds of slow jobs can hide backlog from other workers. Schedule ",["$","code","code-0",{"children":"cron"}]," jobs through the same capacity model: a nightly run that enqueues 10,000 exports is still an arrival burst."]}]
